arch direction in other words if we  had unequivocal  bayesian  high confidence credible evidence that  there are extra i know for me it would  change what research i do that's what  would impact you yeah no i i think it  would absolutely change at least the  flavor of what we're working on um i  i think my personal opinion with based  on very low evidence is that we're going  to find that single cell organisms are  going to be relatively common throughout  the universe i figure

